Reynolds number \$U_\\infty L/\\nu\$ & \\num{$RE} \\\\
Cells (see the mesh report) & \\num{${CELLS:-0}} \\\\
Incidence \$\\alpha\$ (quoted; true \$\\alpha + 2.45^\\circ\$) & ${ANGLE:-?}\\,\\si{\\degree} \\\\
k-\$\\omega\$ SST \$a_1\$ & ${A1:-?} \\\\
Layers on \\texttt{$REF1TEX}: mean / design & ${LAYAVG:-?} / $nLayers \\\\
Processors & $NPROC \\\\
Iterations & $NIT, stopped by: $STOP \\\\
CPU time & \\SI{${CPU:-0}}{s} \\\\\\bottomrule
